    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Carmen Marrero-Morin",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112735831933242959335/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUwev3S5tHdrpUVdQ-XgeMIfE80SkYvzzjaV0ijDWyhvc-WeiXc=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "11 months ago",
        "text": "I found all the employees to me very knowledgeable on the many products they offer.\n\nSaturday, March 1st, both ladies were attentive... but I noticed the door was not shutting due to the wind.  Perhaps this is why the other review was negative.  The door chime didn't go off.  When I enter a store, I often say hello first.\n\n10/10 will shop there again!\n\nGreat boutique for quality hair care!!",
        "time": 1740971128,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Heather Tims",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115346123022304557959/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJDZWJGwcPW447nNlSYVLQYPxlJsdXGNdap-37bzOTwfpoCZw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "11 months ago",
        "text": "I just went (Saturday March 1 12pm) in looking for a particular product from a line this store carries. Two employees watching me look at every product in the wall for at least five minutes, not even a greeting or smile. They just watched me from across the store while talking to each other, and ignoring that I was clearly looking for something. The store was absolutely empty. I was the only customer. I ended up giving up and leaving and will place an order online for what I need. Won’t be returning. Customer service is crap.",
        "time": 1740850273,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "ariane",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100236532950835900705/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL53wuhV-bltoLHwYRLn1cn_U8wLsHLMdATNQePVMHy0DricXI=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "11 months ago",
        "text": "The employees are amazing, never had any bad experiences with any of them, they are more than helpful and capable of explaining the products impeccably in a way that a non professional can understand. Josephine is a sweet young lady that knows what she’s talking about and you can tell how much of a passion it is to her and her recommandations has never failed me or my close ones.",
        "time": 1740959351,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Eka",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117798267602681196089/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUs5Jp9u34H0bH9hxzl8H6XLm-xK0g71_oiNn3o81DXTjszXKU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "Nice store with various hair products",
        "time": 1748974042,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Audrey Laplante",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118125191032373065523/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWYKyNe6nMoz2N03Iy-IrTNPkuK94L5eL7VV1e5w0GDtEECSERD=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Wow, beautiful store! Excellent customer service, the employees are really nice. Especially the manager, she gave me great advice for my hair. Thank you!",
